  "",
  "Route (app)                         Size  First Load JS",
  "┌ ○ /                          4.12 kB         128 kB",
  "├ ƒ /runs                      9.86 kB         141 kB",
  "├ ƒ /runs/[id]                 6.40 kB         137 kB",
